{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15916","headline":"从元太守夏讌西楼 · 王建","name":"从元太守夏讌西楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六月晨亦热，卑居多烦昏。\n五马游西城，几杖随朱轮。\n西楼临方塘，嘉木当华轩。\n凫鷖满中流，有酒复盈尊。\n山东地无山，平视大海垠。\n高风凉气来，灏景沈清源。\n青衿俨坐傍，礼容益敦敦。\n愿爲颜氏徒，歌咏夫子门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}